<https://data.nist.gov/od/dm/chips-metrology/tabular#GeometricalProperties> skos:definition "Dimensional and Geometric Properties quantify spatial extent, shape, orientation, and periodic distances in physical systems and measurement configurations." .
<https://data.nist.gov/od/dm/chips-metrology/tabular#GeometricalProperties> rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .

