<https://data.nist.gov/od/dm/chips-metrology/tabular#MeasurementQuality> skos:definition "Uncertainty, Error, and Quality Attributes quantify the doubt, variability, validation state, and provenance associated with measurements and data." .
<https://data.nist.gov/od/dm/chips-metrology/tabular#MeasurementQuality> rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .

